  i Object.fromEntries() builds the same object from a list of [key, value] pairs in a single step, which is shorter and easier to read.
  
  i Turn each item into a [key, value] pair with map(), then pass the result to Object.fromEntries().
  
  i This rule belongs to the nursery group, which means it is not yet stable and may change in the future. Visit https://biomejs.dev/linter/#nursery for more information.
  

